  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.title": "紫阳花茶会",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.INITIAL.description": "尖塔的喧嚣渐渐远去，眼前是一片盛放的[blue]紫阳花[/blue]。你打了个哈欠，正打算找个隐蔽的角落，[sine]舒舒服服地睡上一觉[/sine]。\n\n花丛中央的凉亭里，三位姐姐却早已备好了红茶与甜点。\n[blue]光辉[/blue]微笑着向你招手；[gold]胜利[/gold]高举茶杯，兴奋地呼唤你的名字；[purple]可畏[/purple]端坐在桌旁，投来的目光让你打消了溜走的念头。\n\n看来，今天的摸鱼计划得稍稍推迟了。你要接受谁的邀请？",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.INITIAL.options.ILLUSTRIOUS.title": "接受光辉的邀请",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.INITIAL.options.ILLUSTRIOUS.description": "将一张[gold]{IllustriousCard}[/gold]添加至你的[gold]牌组[/gold]。",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.INITIAL.options.VICTORIOUS.title": "接受胜利的邀请",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.INITIAL.options.VICTORIOUS.description": "将一张[gold]{VictoriousCard}[/gold]添加至你的[gold]牌组[/gold]。",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.INITIAL.options.FORMIDABLE.title": "接受可畏的邀请",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.INITIAL.options.FORMIDABLE.description": "将一张[gold]{FormidableCard}[/gold]添加至你的[gold]牌组[/gold]。",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.ILLUSTRIOUS_BRANCH.description": "你在光辉身边坐下。她替你倒上红茶，温暖的茶香让你不由得放松了肩膀。\n\n[blue]“愿爱与和平的光芒，时刻庇护着你，我亲爱的妹妹。”[/blue]\n\n她将两瓶药水放在茶碟旁，示意你挑选一瓶带走。连旅途中的安危，她都替你考虑好了。",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.ILLUSTRIOUS_BRANCH.options.SHIELD_POTION.title": "收下护盾",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.ILLUSTRIOUS_BRANCH.options.SHIELD_POTION.description": "获得一瓶[aqua]{ShieldPotion}[/aqua]。",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.ILLUSTRIOUS_BRANCH.options.REGEN_POTION.title": "收下治愈",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.ILLUSTRIOUS_BRANCH.options.REGEN_POTION.description": "获得一瓶[aqua]{RegenPotion}[/aqua]。",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.VICTORIOUS_BRANCH.description": "你刚刚落座，胜利便热情地拍了拍你的肩膀，将一杯特调红茶推到你面前。她的干劲实在有些耀眼，连你的困意都消退了几分。\n\n[gold]“不管敌人有多强，带着必胜的信念出击就对了！干杯！”[/gold]\n\n碰过杯后，她又拿出两瓶药水。看来，临行前你还得从她的珍藏中挑一份助力。",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.VICTORIOUS_BRANCH.options.STRENGTH_POTION.title": "汲取力量",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.VICTORIOUS_BRANCH.options.STRENGTH_POTION.description": "获得一瓶[aqua]{StrengthPotion}[/aqua]。",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.VICTORIOUS_BRANCH.options.FLEX_POTION.title": "激发潜能",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.VICTORIOUS_BRANCH.options.FLEX_POTION.description": "获得一瓶[aqua]{FlexPotion}[/aqua]。",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.FORMIDABLE_BRANCH.description": "你轻手轻脚地坐在可畏对面。她优雅地端起茶杯，微微颔首，仿佛方才那个想偷偷溜走的人根本不存在。\n\n[purple]“既然来了，就好好享受这片刻的安宁吧。也别忘了仪态哦。”[/purple]\n\n茶点旁摆着两瓶药水：一瓶让你想到危险的火苗，另一瓶仿佛能让人[sine]沉沉睡去[/sine]。可畏将它们推近了些，等着你做出选择。",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.FORMIDABLE_BRANCH.options.FLAMMABLE_POTION.title": "选择热烈",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.FORMIDABLE_BRANCH.options.FLAMMABLE_POTION.description": "获得一瓶[aqua]{FlammablePotion}[/aqua]。",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.FORMIDABLE_BRANCH.options.HYPNOTIC_POTION.title": "选择安眠",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.FORMIDABLE_BRANCH.options.HYPNOTIC_POTION.description": "获得一瓶[aqua]{HypnoticPotion}[/aqua]。",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.END.description": "杯中的红茶见了底，茶会也到了散场的时候。\n\n你收好礼物，恋恋不舍地望向那片适合补觉的紫阳花。尖塔的挑战还在前方等着你。\n\n你伸了个懒腰，带着姐姐们的祝福，不情不愿地继续前进。\n[sine]等回来以后，再好好睡一觉吧……[/sine]",
  "INDOMITABLESPIRE2-HYDRANGEA_TEA_PARTY.pages.END.options.LEAVE.title": "离开",
